Subject: [PATCH] Add evdev lightgun support

Open up to four light guns tagged ID_INPUT_GUN by udev, grab them and
feed their absolute position and buttons to emulated ports 0-3. The
devices are read from a thread that sleeps in poll() and drops a gun
that goes away. Linux only; links libudev explicitly.
---
